{"seq":1,"slug":"referral-code-link-generation-model","title":"推荐码与分享链接生成模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/referral-mgm-invite-friend-growth-program/referral-code-attribution-lifecycle/referral-code-link-generation-model","wordCount":2860,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"推荐码与分享链接生成模型\">推荐码与分享链接生成模型</h1><p>推荐码不是随手拼的字符串，而是一个<strong>需在三个互相拉扯的约束下求解的值类型</strong>：短到能在微信里口口相传、不含易混字符到能被人正确复述、在十亿级用户下不碰撞，还要在跨消息App、跨浏览器、跨应用商店的漫长链路上保住&quot;谁邀请了谁&quot;这条归因事实。任何约束单独看都简单，是它们叠在一起才产生工程难度——短码要求低信息量，唯一性要求高熵，可读性要求排除一批字符。本文只讨论码与链接的<strong>生成与归因载体</strong>，落地后的奖励结算与台账不在此展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>一条推荐链接从生成到被计入归因，要穿过至少四段彼此失联的介质：生成服务、消息App的预览抓取、浏览器/WebView的重定向、以及应用商店的安装回调。每一段都可能丢参数，所以核心问题不是&quot;怎么生成码&quot;，而是**&quot;在哪一段承载身份、在哪一段只承载路由&quot;**，并把可丢失与不可丢失的参数分层。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[生成服务&lt;br/&gt;分配码/令牌] --&gt; B[链接物化&lt;br/&gt;短链+渠道子码]&#10;  B --&gt; C[分享渠道&lt;br/&gt;IM 预览抓取]&#10;  C --&gt; D[落地页&lt;br/&gt;302 重定向]&#10;  D --&gt; E{是否已装 App}&#10;  E --&gt;|已装| F[Universal/App Link&lt;br/&gt;直接带参唤起]&#10;  E --&gt;|未装| G[应用商店&lt;br/&gt;Install Referrer / 剪贴板]&#10;  F --&gt; H[归因服务&lt;br/&gt;码 → 邀请人]&#10;  G --&gt; H&#10;  H --&gt; I[奖励台账&lt;br/&gt;待结算]\">graph TD\n  A[生成服务&lt;br/&gt;分配码/令牌] --&gt; B[链接物化&lt;br/&gt;短链+渠道子码]\n  B --&gt; C[分享渠道&lt;br/&gt;IM 预览抓取]\n  C --&gt; D[落地页&lt;br/&gt;302 重定向]\n  D --&gt; E{是否已装 App}\n  E --&gt;|已装| F[Universal/App Link&lt;br/&gt;直接带参唤起]\n  E --&gt;|未装| G[应用商店&lt;br/&gt;Install Referrer / 剪贴板]\n  F --&gt; H[归因服务&lt;br/&gt;码 → 邀请人]\n  G --&gt; H\n  H --&gt; I[奖励台账&lt;br/&gt;待结算]</pre><p>三种码生成策略的取舍，直接决定归因能否自证：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>码形态</th>\n<th>唯一性来源</th>\n<th>归因强度</th>\n<th>主要风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>自增 ID + 编码</td>\n<td><code>8F3K2</code></td>\n<td>数据库主键</td>\n<td>强（可反查）</td>\n<td>码可枚举，竞品能爬邀请关系</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>随机不透明码</td>\n<td><code>X7QP9M4</code></td>\n<td>随机 + 唯一索引</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>需碰撞重试；无内建校验位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>带签名令牌</td>\n<td><code>eyJ...</code></td>\n<td>密钥签名</td>\n<td>最强（可离线验）</td>\n<td>码过长，无法口述</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>哈希映射（Hashids 类）</td>\n<td><code>kR9dP2</code></td>\n<td>密钥 + 盐</td>\n<td>中（可逆）</td>\n<td>盐泄露即全量可逆</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>生产系统通常<strong>组合使用</strong>：对外口述用短的不透明码，链接里嵌含渠道信息的子码，服务端再用签名令牌校验短链跳转真实性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"码值与编码空间设计\">码值与编码空间设计</h2><p>编码字母表的选择先于长度选择。Crockford Base32 是可读短码的事实标准之一：字母表为 <code>0123456789ABCDEFGHJKMNPQRSTVWXYZ</code>，刻意排除 <code>I</code>、<code>L</code>、<code>O</code>、<code>U</code>——<code>I</code>/<code>L</code> 易与 <code>1</code> 混淆、<code>O</code> 易与 <code>0</code> 混淆，<code>U</code> 被排除是为避免随机组合出现冒犯性单词（来源：Crockford Base32 规范，<a href=\"https://www.crockford.com/base32.html）。解码时宽容地把\">https://www.crockford.com/base32.html）。解码时宽容地把</a> <code>i</code>/<code>l</code> 视作 <code>1</code>、<code>o</code> 视作 <code>0</code>，编码时只输出大写，这对客服人工核码极其关键。</p>\n<p>Base32 每字符承载 5 bit，码长为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 时总空间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>32</mn><mi>L</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N = 32^{L}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。已发放 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个码时，按生日界，至少一次碰撞的概率近似为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>collision</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≈</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>N</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(\\text{collision}) \\approx 1 - \\exp\\left(-\\frac{n(n-1)}{2N}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">collision</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">exp</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>反解出给定碰撞概率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span> 下的最小码长：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">⌈</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">⌉</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L \\ge \\left\\lceil \\frac{\\log_2\\left(\\frac{n(n-1)}{2\\epsilon}\\right)}{5} \\right\\rceil</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.74em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.6em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.667em;height:3.6em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.667em\" height=\"3.6em\" viewBox=\"0 0 667 3600\"><path d=\"M403 1759 V84 H666 V0 H319 V1759 v1200 v602 h84z\nM403 1759 V0 H319 V1759 v1200 v602 h84z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.19em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.464em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.38em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.19em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.01em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ϵ</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.485em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.6em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.667em;height:3.6em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.667em\" height=\"3.6em\" viewBox=\"0 0 667 3600\"><path d=\"M347 1759 V0 H0 V84 H263 V1759 v1200 v602 h84z\nM347 1759 V0 h-84 V1759 v1200 v602 h84z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>代入电商常见的规模，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>8</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n = 10^{8}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">8</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（一亿个已发码）、容忍 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon = 10^{-6}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>码长 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>空间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>32</mn><mi>L</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">32^L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>6</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n=10^6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 时碰撞率</th>\n<th><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>8</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n=10^8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">8</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 时碰撞率</th>\n<th>可口述性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3.36</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>7</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3.36 \\times 10^{7}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3.36</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>1.5%</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>极佳</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.07</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>9</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.07 \\times 10^{9}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.07</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">9</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>0.05%</td>\n<td>~99%</td>\n<td>佳</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>7</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3.44</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>10</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3.44 \\times 10^{10}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3.44</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">10</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>可忽略</td>\n<td>13.6%</td>\n<td>可</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>8</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.10</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>12</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.10 \\times 10^{12}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.10</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">12</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>可忽略</td>\n<td>0.45%</td>\n<td>略长</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>结论是：<strong>7–8 位是亿级发码量下短码的甜点区</strong>。若坚持 5–6 位的极致可读性，就必须接受碰撞重试（生成时撞到唯一索引即重抽），而重试在分布式并发写下的代价随填充率上升而陡增——当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n/N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 超过 10% 时重试期望次数显著恶化，此时应改用更长的码或加命名空间分片（如 <code>区号 + 短码</code>）隔离碰撞域。</p>\n<p>Crockford Base32 还提供可选的<strong>校验符</strong>：附加一位，取原数值对 37 取模（37 是大于 32 的最小素数），额外用到 <code>*</code>(32)、<code>~</code>(33)、<code>$</code>(34)、<code>=</code>(35)、<code>U</code>(36) 五个符号（来源同上）。校验符能检出单符号错误与相邻换位错误——这正是用户手抄推荐码时最常见的两类错误。加不加是成本权衡：多一位损失可口述性，但把客服&quot;我的码用不了&quot;这类工单显著压低。面向手输场景（线下物料、名片、直播口播）建议加，纯点击链接不必加。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分享链接的物化与渠道适配\">分享链接的物化与渠道适配</h2><p>码生成之后要&quot;物化&quot;成可点击的链接，而不同渠道对参数的保留能力差异极大。设计原则是<strong>把不可丢失的身份参数放在路径段，把可丢失的来源参数放在查询串</strong>——很多 IM 预览抓取与部分代理缓存会裁剪查询串，而路径段几乎总能穿透。</p>\n<p>链接解剖如下，各段职责互不重叠：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>链接成分</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n<th>职责</th>\n<th>可否丢失</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>路径码</td>\n<td><code>/r/X7QP9M4</code></td>\n<td>邀请人身份（必留）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>渠道子码</td>\n<td><code>?c=wx_group</code></td>\n<td>分享者所在渠道</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>活动标识</td>\n<td><code>&amp;cp=double_2026q4</code></td>\n<td>双边奖励活动版本</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>落地目标</td>\n<td><code>&amp;to=pdp_8891</code></td>\n<td>被邀请人落地页</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>签名</td>\n<td><code>&amp;s=9f2a...</code></td>\n<td>防篡改校验</td>\n<td>否（校验用）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>短链服务有两个容易踩的坑。<strong>重定向要用 302 而非 301</strong>：301 会被浏览器与中介永久缓存，一旦某邀请链接被 301 缓存，该 URL 的渠道子码变更将永远不生效（见 MDN <code>HTTP redirection</code>）。同时落地页应显式声明 <code>Referrer-Policy</code>，否则跨站跳转时浏览器可能按默认策略截断 referrer（见 MDN <code>Referrer-Policy</code>）。</p>\n<p>微信、WhatsApp 等 IM 会在分享时抓取链接生成预览卡片，这个过程会<strong>独立地</strong>请求一次短链。不加处理就会把&quot;预览抓取&quot;计入点击，污染后续转化率与反作弊基线。标准做法是识别 IM 抓取的 User-Agent（如微信的 <code>MicroMessenger</code> 机器人），对这类请求返回不带计数与归因埋点的静态卡片，只有真实点击才触发归因写入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"归因窗口与跨端落地\">归因窗口与跨端落地</h2><p>推荐归因最难的一段是&quot;用户在 App 未安装时点了链接&quot;。这需要<strong>延迟深度链接（deferred deep linking）</strong>：先跳应用商店，安装完成后首次打开时把当初的点击上下文还原出来。Branch 的术语文档把它描述为&quot;让链接携带数据与上下文穿过整个安装过程&quot;，从而把原始点击与首次启动关联起来（来源：<a href=\"https://www.branch.io/glossary/deferred-deep-linking/）。还原手段有三条，可靠性递减：商店级安装引荐参数（Android\">https://www.branch.io/glossary/deferred-deep-linking/）。还原手段有三条，可靠性递减：商店级安装引荐参数（Android</a> 用 Google Play Install Referrer，可靠性最高但只覆盖 Play 渠道）；剪贴板/指纹兜底（落地页把码写进剪贴板，App 首次启动读取比对，iOS 读取会弹提示）；概率指纹匹配（依赖 IP + 设备特征，ATT 之后精度大幅下降，仅作兜底）。</p>\n<p>已安装用户走另一条路：<strong>App Links / Universal Links</strong>，让 HTTPS 链接绕过浏览器直接唤起 App。两者配置与校验机制不同，归因系统必须同时支持：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>Android App Links</th>\n<th>iOS Universal Links</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>声明文件</td>\n<td><code>/.well-known/assetlinks.json</code></td>\n<td><code>/.well-known/apple-app-site-association</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>信任锚</td>\n<td>包名 + 签名证书 SHA-256 指纹</td>\n<td>Apple Team ID + Bundle ID</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最低版本</td>\n<td>Android 6.0（API 23）</td>\n<td>iOS 9</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重验证</td>\n<td>Android 15+ 周期性后台复验，最长约 7 天</td>\n<td>安装/更新时拉取，缓存由系统控制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>调试</td>\n<td><code>adb shell pm get-app-links &lt;pkg&gt;</code></td>\n<td><code>?mode=developer</code> 绕缓存</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Android 侧验证失败有明确的状态机：<code>pm get-app-links</code> 会输出 <code>verified</code>、<code>denied</code>、<code>legacy_failure</code>、<code>migrated</code> 等状态，以及大于 1024 的设备验证器错误码（来源：Android 官方 App Links 验证文档，<a href=\"https://developer.android.com/training/app-links/verify-android-applinks）。工程上应把\">https://developer.android.com/training/app-links/verify-android-applinks）。工程上应把</a> domain verification 状态纳入监控——一次证书轮换若漏更 <code>assetlinks.json</code>，会静默地让归因退化成浏览器打开，表现为&quot;App Links 转化率骤降&quot;而无人报警。iOS 的 AASA 必须通过 HTTPS 直接提供、不允许重定向，且不要求 <code>.json</code> 扩展名，都是常见失误点（来源：Apple <code>Supporting associated domains</code> 文档）。</p>\n<p>iOS 14.5 之后跨 App 广告归因受 ATT 限制，SKAdNetwork 成为受限替代。但<strong>推荐码归因不依赖广告标识</strong>——它是用户主动传递、由服务端持有的邀请关系，因此比广告归因更抗隐私政策变化。这是推荐链路的结构性优势：身份放在服务端可验证的码里，而非设备标识上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"生命周期状态机与失效\">生命周期状态机与失效</h2><p>码不是生成后就静止的对象，它有明确的状态机。把状态建模清楚，是冻结、复用、转移、轮换的前提，也让&quot;某个码能不能用&quot;由单一权威源回答，而非散落各处的 if 判断。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  R[RESERVED&lt;br/&gt;已预占] --&gt; A[ACTIVE&lt;br/&gt;可用]&#10;  A --&gt; P[PAUSED&lt;br/&gt;暂停]&#10;  P --&gt; A&#10;  A --&gt; X[REVOKED&lt;br/&gt;作废]&#10;  A --&gt; E[EXPIRED&lt;br/&gt;过期]&#10;  A --&gt; C[CONSUMED&lt;br/&gt;已核销]&#10;  X --&gt; Z[RECYCLED&lt;br/&gt;回收待复用]\">graph TD\n  R[RESERVED&lt;br/&gt;已预占] --&gt; A[ACTIVE&lt;br/&gt;可用]\n  A --&gt; P[PAUSED&lt;br/&gt;暂停]\n  P --&gt; A\n  A --&gt; X[REVOKED&lt;br/&gt;作废]\n  A --&gt; E[EXPIRED&lt;br/&gt;过期]\n  A --&gt; C[CONSUMED&lt;br/&gt;已核销]\n  X --&gt; Z[RECYCLED&lt;br/&gt;回收待复用]</pre><p>关键决策有三点。<strong>其一，&quot;一码多人&quot;还是&quot;一人一码&quot;</strong>：老带新通常一人一个稳定码（便于记住并反复分享），单次活动常发一次性码（精确对应某张券）——前者要求码与邀请人一对一绑定、长期有效，后者要求 <code>CONSUMED</code> 状态与幂等核销。<strong>其二，失效的粒度</strong>：作废作用于&quot;码&quot;还是&quot;码 + 渠道子码&quot;？若某渠道被判定刷单，正确做法是只冻结该渠道的归因，而非作废用户的整张码——否则误伤该用户在其它渠道的正常分享。<strong>其三，回收与复用</strong>：短码空间在亿级规模下会紧张，<code>REVOKED</code> 的码在冷却期后能否重分配？需评估已分发的线下物料是否仍在外流通，通常建议<strong>永不复用已进入线下的码</strong>，只回收纯线上、从未物化的号段。</p>\n<p>ID 分配层建议用**分段号池（号段租借）**而非中心化自增：每个生成节点向中心租借一段（如 10 万个）后本地自增发放，避免每次发码都跨网络写主库。需要全局有序时用 ULID——前 48 bit 是毫秒时间戳、剩余是随机位，既单调可排又无需协调。号池本身保证唯一性，随机短码的索引碰撞重试只作兜底。</p>\n<p>最后，归因写入必须<strong>幂等</strong>：同一次点击可能因预览抓取、刷新、链接转发而多次落地。归因服务应以&quot;邀请人码 + 被邀请人账号 + 时间窗&quot;为去重键，用条件写入（唯一约束或 compare-and-set）保证只记一条，否则会直接放大后续奖励成本。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>推荐码是<strong>在可读性、唯一性、可口述性三者间求平衡的值类型</strong>，不是普通字符串。</li>\n<li>编码选 Crockford Base32，排除 <code>ILOU</code>，可选加 mod 37 校验符；7–8 位是亿级发码量的甜点区。</li>\n<li>码长下界由生日界给出：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>≥</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌈</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>ϵ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌉</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L \\ge \\lceil \\log_2(n(n-1)/(2\\epsilon)) / 5 \\rceil</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌈</span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span><span class=\"mord\">/5</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌉</span></span></span></span></span>；填充率超 10% 后碰撞重试代价陡增，应改分片或加长。</li>\n<li>链接分段承载职责：<strong>路径段放身份，查询串放来源</strong>；短链用 302 不用 301。</li>\n<li>跨端归因三条腿：商店 Install Referrer、剪贴板兜底、已安装用户的 App Links / Universal Links；<code>assetlinks.json</code> 与 AASA 验证状态必须进监控。</li>\n<li>推荐码归因把身份放在服务端而非设备标识，因而比广告归因更<strong>抗 ATT / 隐私政策变化</strong>。</li>\n<li>码要建状态机（RESERVED/ACTIVE/PAUSED/REVOKED/EXPIRED/CONSUMED），失效粒度到&quot;码 × 渠道&quot;，归因写入必须幂等。</li>\n<li>ID 分配用<strong>号段租借 + ULID</strong> 避免中心化写热点，随机短码的索引碰撞重试只作兜底。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>被邀请人落地后的奖励结算、台账与反作弊判定属于后续工程环节，不在本篇展开。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"推荐码与分享链接生成模型","id":"推荐码与分享链接生成模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"码值与编码空间设计","id":"码值与编码空间设计"},{"level":2,"text":"分享链接的物化与渠道适配","id":"分享链接的物化与渠道适配"},{"level":2,"text":"归因窗口与跨端落地","id":"归因窗口与跨端落地"},{"level":2,"text":"生命周期状态机与失效","id":"生命周期状态机与失效"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"计划规则与地区合规边界设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/referral-mgm-invite-friend-growth-program/referral-program-model-incentive-design/program-rules-region-compliance-design"},"next":{"title":"归因窗口与跨端身份拼接机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/referral-mgm-invite-friend-growth-program/referral-code-attribution-lifecycle/attribution-identity-stitching-mechanism"}}